# Token budget

## Default behavior

- Answer in **1–5 short sentences** unless the user asks for detail.
- **One** focused tool pass when possible; no broad repo sweeps «на всякий случай».
- Prefer `rg`/`Glob` with a **narrow path** over whole-repo search.
- Do **not** re-read huge files already in context; do **not** paste long logs/diffs into the reply.
- Do **not** start parallel explore agents / Bugbot / Security Review unless the user asks.
- Do **not** restate the whole plan after every step — only what changed / what to do next.
- New chat for a **new** topic; keep this thread for the same bug/feature.

## When coding

- Touch the smallest set of files; no drive-by refactors.
- Skip long explanations of unchanged code.
- Ask one clarifying question instead of exploring five wrong trees.

## Deploy / prod

- Prefer the user’s stated ship path; do not re-open deploy/docs unless the task is deploy.
